THIS FILE IS A PLACEHOLDER.

Replace this file with your trained TFLite model (submission/model.tflite).

Requirements
------------
- Format   : TensorFlow Lite (.tflite)
- File name: model.tflite  (exact name required)

ESP32-S3 constraints (verified automatically by evaluate_constraint.py)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
  - Model file size  < 1 MB   (Flash budget)
  - Tensor arena     < 200 KB (SRAM budget, no external PSRAM)
  - No LSTM / GRU / RNN operations
  - INT8 quantization strongly recommended

Run the constraint check before every submission:
    python evaluation/evaluate_constraint.py --model-path submission/model.tflite
